","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"鼒","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《周書》王褒傳末記子鼒嗣，《舊唐書》明載其為王方慶祖父及隋衞尉丞。"},{"id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89:p001:m0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"弘直","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《舊唐書》明載王方慶父弘直、祖鼒；二者相鄰為編輯組接。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89","book_id":"b-jiutangshu-089","work_id":"w-jiutangshu","source_id":"s-jiutangshu-089-tang89-ws2589393"},{"id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89:p002","text":"長安二年五月卒，贈袞州都督，諡曰貞。中宗即位，以宮僚之舊，追贈吏部尚書。方慶博學好著述，所撰雜書凡二百餘卷。尤精《三禮》，好事者多詢訪之。每所酬答，鹹有典據，故時人編次，名曰《禮雜答問》。聚書甚多，不減秘閣，至於圖畫，亦多異本。諸子莫能守其業，卒後尋亦散亡。長子光輔，開元中官至潞州刺史。少子晙，工書知名，尤善琴棋，而性多嚴整，官至殿中侍御史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89:p002:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"方慶","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAAA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《舊唐書》稱王方慶，《新唐書》本傳明載王綝字方慶，兩傳均稱父弘直。"},{"id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89:p002:m0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"光輔","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAAAA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《舊唐書》本傳載王方慶長子光輔。"},{"id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89:p002:m0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"晙","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAAAAAB","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《舊唐書》本傳載王方慶少子晙；原文未明數字排行。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jiutangshu-089-tang89","book_id":"b-jiutangshu-089","work_id":"w-jiutangshu","source_id":"s-jiutangshu-089-tang89-ws2589393"},{"id":"c-xintangshu-116-xintang116:p001","text":"王綝，字方慶，以字顯。其先自丹楊徙雍咸陽。父弘直，為漢王元昌友。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-xintangshu-116-xintang116:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王綝","kind":"person","person_id":